# 0223 = 0222 + Function framework (probe/log separation).
#   ruby_function registry (Linux usb_function analogue) + probe/log
#   registered as NULL-setup functions for now. EP0 standard setup
#   reaches functions first, then falls through to STALL.
#   ruby_cmd_dispatch renamed to ruby_func_probe_dispatch.
